  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Six sound tea is Shen clan’s signature set of six cups, famous across the five regions and made of immortal materials by Gu refinement experts among Gu Immortals. Autumn wood sound is the first cup. The tea is crystal clear, like a sky devoid of clouds. Drinking it refreshes the mind and feels like moving casually in autumn skies. When Shen Cong Sheng hosts Qi Sea Ancestor with top grade ingredients, he expends a large amount of rank eight immortal materials for the full set.",
      "chapters": [
        1850
      ],
