    },
    {
      "text": "Shen Cong Sheng later expends rank eight immortal materials to brew the first cup of six sound tea for Lu Wei Yin and Shen Shang; that cup is called autumn wood sound. The tea is again crystal clear and pure, and drinking it clears the mind with the same autumn-sky sensation.",
